A red row outside its prediction is re-run ALONE before it is believed or recorded.
Load: probes run while #529's kill table 7 also runs (4 lanes).  This probe waits on wall-clock `settle'/`spin'
windows and retries a session ONCE with tripled patience when a print is missing; a load-starved session shows as
`absent' values, which the prediction checker reports as a DIFFERENCE and the re-run-alone rule then settles.
